<title>SRI LANKA: Commercial Bank 3-month net up 16.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Commercial Bank 3-month net up 16.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Commercial Bank of Ceylon Ltd for the three months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupee sunless stated):</p>
<p>			  1996		1997</p>
<p>    Turnover	 844.98    vs    699.26</p>
<p>    Net profit	97.96    vs     83.98</p>
<p>    Tax provision   38.60    vs     42.50</p>
<p>NOTE - The blue chip Commercial Bank is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
